    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="top" type="letterhead">BUREAU OF OCCUPATIONS, Inc. <lb/>AGENCY
                        <lb/>Social Work, Personnel, Statistics, Publicity <lb/>Advertising,
                        Publishing, Home Economics <lb/>1776 BROADWAY–<rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">NEW YORK</rs>
                        <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3352" type="person">MARY WATSON</rs>
                        <lb/>Director</fw><dateline><date when="1945-11-21">November 21,
                        1945</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In registering with our Bureau <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3353" type="person"
                        >Mrs. Margaret Blumenfeld Plaut</rs> has given your name as reference. Will
                    you therefore be good enough to give us your estimate of her ability?</p>
                <closer><salute>Sincerely yours,</salute><signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3352"
                            type="person">Mary
                        Watson</rs><!-- Zur Signatur etw. sehr unleserliches, aber vermutl. weniger relevantes + unter der Signatur nochmals gedruckt: Mary Watson --></signed>
                    <fw place="bottom" type="adressline"><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928"
                            type="person">Prof. Paul Tillich</rs>
                        <lb/>Union Theological Seminary <lb/>Broadway and 120th St. <lb/><rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York</rs>, <rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__865" type="place">N. Y.</rs></fw><fw
                        place="bottom">A Vocational Service for Men and Women</fw>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
